        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, computer, laptop, office use</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, computer, laptop, office use
The laptop computer office use is calculated according to the share between active (5.5 hrs/day), standby (2 hrs/day) and off (16.5 hrs/day) modes taken from literature information.;
Synonyms: Notebook, Lifebook; 
UUID: 729a78a7-3d78-38d8-b192-a60ac8e6989c
Describes the use of a laptop computer in an office. Calculated per 1 hour of laptop use in an office. UCTE production mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: No technology involved, except for the production of the laptop computer, which is described in another dataset.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, producer information and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: Daily experiences confirm retrieved data from literature.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_729a78a7-3d78-38d8-b192-a60ac8e6989c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
